### Create Luxury Penthouse Suite (POST)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Luxury Penthouse Suite",
  "description": "Panoramic floor-to-ceiling Las Vegas Strip views, wrap-around balcony, private hot tub, and dedicated butler service.",
  "price": 850.00,
  "maxOccupancy": 4,
  "amenities": [
    "King Bed",
    "Strip View",
    "Private Hot Tub",
    "Butler Service",
    "Free Wi-Fi"
  ],
  "isAvailable": true,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582719478250-c89cae4dc85b"
}

### Create Executive Double Queen Room (POST)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Executive Double Queen Room",
  "description": "Spacious room featuring two plush queen beds, ergonomic workstation, and marble bathroom.",
  "price": 229.00,
  "maxOccupancy": 4,
  "amenities": [
    "Two Queen Beds",
    "Workstation",
    "Marble Bathroom",
    "Mini Fridge"
  ],
  "isAvailable": true
}

### Get All Hotel Rooms (GET)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/products

### Get Single Room by ID (GET)
# Replace ROOM_ID_HERE with a valid _id returned from the GET request above
GET http://localhost:4000/api/products/ROOM_ID_HERE